# Terac MCP

This repo must use Terac MCP for agent hires. Endpoint: `https://terac.com/api/mcp`.

When this chat needs a human (ship verify, trade confidence, research, review):

1. Call `terac_get_context` first.
2. Launch with `terac_create_opportunity` then `terac_launch_draft_opportunity` (or the draft/launch tools that exist).
3. Poll with `terac_get_submissions` / `terac_get_submission`. Do not invent a timeout-to-consensus.
4. Approve or reject with the matching Terac MCP tools.

The cockpit backend may still hire over REST (`/api/terac/*`). That loop does not replace MCP. Do not tell the user REST satisfies the hackathon MCP rule.

Never paste `TERAC_API_KEY` or other secrets into chat, commits, or `mcp.json`.
